# Boot splash.
#
# cmdline.txt carries "quiet splash logo.nologo plymouth.ignore-serial-consoles"
# to match the live machine; those tokens only mean anything if Plymouth is
# actually installed, so it is named here rather than assumed.
#
# NOTE for 06-seat: Plymouth's DRM renderer takes DRM MASTER. That is why the
# reflex-ui drop-in orders After=plymouth-quit-wait.service. Installing
# Plymouth and forgetting the ordering is the most likely way to produce a
# black screen on a machine that has no terminal to debug it from.
#
# Custom splash ART is deliberately NOT here. The theme stays stock: art is
# cosmetic, and shipping a placeholder would make it look done.

plymouth
plymouth-themes
